# Evidence regenerates from the user's own exe: commit the scripts and the
# small derived slot tables, never disassembly dumps (THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
# section 4a caps whole-function listings) or other projects' downloaded files.
*
!.gitignore
!*/
!*.py
!*.cpp
!*.cmd
!*.md
!*.json
# the upstream search downloaded other projects' headers, source and issue text
C-upstream-search/
__pycache__/
